  questId: c5_tally
  questName: The Tally Sheet
  primaryRiasec: C
  questionCode: C5
  objectiveText: Total the figures and get them into the record.
  questDescription: The term's attendance figures are due at the district office.
    Right now they are loose slips in three piles, with nothing added up.
  questHints:
  - The slips are in three piles - gather them before you total anything.
  - Or check the running totals; one column was added wrong.
